WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.420
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.809
Maya shows a picture and talks, and nobody in the room understands her!

3
00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:09.213
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:09.613 --> 00:00:11.889
This is Episode 86.

5
00:00:12.289 --> 00:00:14.230
Meet the talking friends.

6
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.481
The eye looks at a picture and says what it sees.

7
00:00:17.881 --> 00:00:20.798
The ear listens and knows if you are happy or sad.

8
00:00:21.198 --> 00:00:23.365
The bell reads cards out loud.

9
00:00:23.765 --> 00:00:26.064
The quill writes down what it hears.

10
00:00:26.464 --> 00:00:29.282
The bridge turns your words into another language.

11
00:00:29.682 --> 00:00:32.111
The window pulls drawings off a paper.

12
00:00:32.511 --> 00:00:34.376
The parrot chats back.

13
00:00:34.776 --> 00:00:37.150
The owl finds the one card you need.

14
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.231
And the little robot?

15
00:00:39.631 --> 00:00:42.699
It learns by watching, and gets better every day.

16
00:00:43.099 --> 00:00:51.435
That is AWS AI: Rekognition, Comprehend, Polly, Transcribe, Translate, Textract, Lex, Kendra and SageMaker.

17
00:00:51.835 --> 00:00:54.004
Now you know the talking friends!

18
00:00:54.404 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

